The plate is "1s3 PSt".
The alphabet is "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz".
The capitals is "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ".
The base is character 0 of alphabet.
The upbase is character 0 of capitals.
Keep a shared needed as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every letter from 0 to 25.
Place 0 into needed.

The platelast is the last position of plate.
For every spot from 0 to platelast.
The symbol is character spot of plate.
The lower is 0.
If symbol is at least base and symbol is at most base plus 25, set lower to symbol.
If symbol is at least upbase and symbol is at most upbase plus 25, set lower to symbol plus base minus upbase.
If lower is more than 0.
The index is lower minus base.
Set item index of needed to item index of needed plus 1.

The words is a list of "step", "steps", "stripe", and "stepp".
The wordlast is the last position of words.
The slots is wordlast plus 1.
The size is slots times 26.
Keep a shared lettercounts as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to size minus 1.
Place 0 into lettercounts.

For every slot from 0 to wordlast.
The word is item slot of words.
The letters is the last position of word.
For every spot from 0 to letters.
The symbol is character spot of word.
The index is symbol minus base.
Set item (slot times 26 plus index) of lettercounts to item (slot times 26 plus index) of lettercounts plus 1.

Keep a shared good as 0.
To inspect with slot (a whole number).
Set good to 1.
For every letter from 0 to 25.
The have is item (slot times 26 plus letter) of lettercounts.
If have is less than item letter of needed, set good to 0.

The best is -1.
The bestsize is 0.
For every slot from 0 to wordlast.
Inspect with slot.
The word is item slot of words.
The end is the last position of word.
The sizeword is end plus 1.
If good is 1 and best is -1, set best to slot, set bestsize to sizeword.
If good is 1 and best is not -1 and sizeword is less than bestsize, set best to slot, set bestsize to sizeword.

Show item best of words.
